  cooling_solution.
- Cut embodied-schemas 0.7.0: release PR, then the annotated tag v0.7.0 on
  the merge commit, which triggers the trusted-publishing publish.yml.
- The user chose to raise graphs to Python >=3.10 (ES needs it).
- The CI pin moved to the release commit b2baa38 at all 8 sites.

### 5. A2 -- lookup by kind (#272)

- kpu_access.py: `kpu_block_of`, `kpu_die_of`, `has_kpu_block`,
  `KPUBlockLookupError(LookupError)`.
- All blocks[0] sites now use it. The SoC plan's multi-block dies need the
